After you create the private connection, update the VPC endpoint policy to allow access to the
OpenSearch UI application in the VPC endpoint policy by specifying the application ID.
For information about updating a VPC endpoint policy, see Update a VPC endpoint policy in the
AWS PrivateLink Guide.
Updating the VPC endpoint policy to allow access to the OpenSearch UI application
1676
Amazon OpenSearch Service
Developer Guide
Ensure that the VPC endpoint policy includes the following statement. Replace the placeholder
value with your own information.
{
"Statement": [{
"Action": ["opensearch:*"],
"Effect": "Allow",
"Principal": "*",
"Resource": "*",
"Condition": {
"StringEquals": {
"opensearch:ApplicationId": ["opensearch-ui-application-id"]
}
}
}]
}
